Package: malariafwd
Title: Forward Simulation of Plasmodium vivax Transmission and Genetics
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Shazia", "Ruybal-Pesantez", email = "shazia.ruybal@isglobal.org",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An R interface to a SLiM (Eidos) + tskit individual-based forward
    simulator of Plasmodium vivax malaria. Models blood-stage infection, the
    hypnozoite reservoir and relapses, meiotic recombination in the mosquito, and
    importation/interventions on a neutral 14-chromosome PvP01 genome, recording a
    tskit tree sequence for ground-truth identity-by-descent. The package runs the
    model from R (single runs and parallel multi-seed / multi-parameter sweeps) and
    provides tidy loaders, epidemiological + genetic metrics, ground-truth IBD via
    tskit, and plotting helpers.
URL: https://github.com/shaziaruybal/malariafwd, https://shaziaruybal.github.io/malariafwd/
BugReports: https://github.com/shaziaruybal/malariafwd/issues
